{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1120692-oath-of-fosterage","id":1120692,"title":"Oath of Fosterage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-26T00:46:25-07:00","id":1120692,"title":"Oath of Fosterage","content":"I am going to run a story soon, and I want to start right of when the PCs have their Chrysalis. So it means that soon afterwards, provided they survive (as they will be pursued by some very nasty critters attracted to the Dream Dance), they will be brought to the local ducal court, and will have a ward named to overlook their fosterage period.<br /> <br /> I plan to roleplay the whole session, with the fledglings and the guardian (another PC) both swearing their respective oaths.<br /> <br /> I remember that someone had devised these oaths or having read them in a book, but for the like of me, I can't find them any where.<br /> <br /> Do you know where I could find the oath of fosterage?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3747-mattboggan","name":"mattboggan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T15:37:55-07:00","id":1121053,"title":"","content":"There's an Oath of Adoption in Kithbook Trolls on page 40 in its own box. There's neither boon nor ban, so you would have to make them up. Someone on Shadownessence speculated that the boon would be the ability to always know where the ward is. though they were still working on a Ban. C20 says on page 266 that motleys alter the Oath of Truehearts. In our game, we've always used Oath of Clasped Hands (and a clean, prehensile foot in the case of sluagh.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T11:50:37-07:00","id":1121434,"title":"","content":"Thanks!<br /> <br /> I guess I had asked that question on ShadownEssence. I will try to look out there now that it has come back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3747-mattboggan","name":"mattboggan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3747_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-27T12:17:16-07:00","id":1121448,"title":"","content":"For the curious, I just found my old post, and the answers that were given:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://shadownessence.org/index.php?/topic/36219-oath-of-fosterage/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://shadownessence.org/index.php?/topic/36219-oath-of-fosterage/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://shadownessence.org/index.php?/topic/36219-oath-of-fosterage/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://shadownessence.org/index.php?/topic/36219-oath-of-fosterage/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div>